  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.3-beta.1`\n\n### Features\n\n- name local terminal tabs after the shell they start, numbering repeats, instead of OS terminal ([a2cdddc4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/a2cdddc4dee2b780985c2b4a243d7079f41fd4cb))\n- reset a garbled terminal from the context menu or a shortcut, including the console behind a local Windows shell, and redraw the prompt when the shell waits at one ([15743e65](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/15743e65f93df0318191b6a841fdda12b1465436))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- pause terminal output until xterm.js acknowledges what it parsed, so cat on a large file no longer freezes the window ([dfd5d3a0](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/dfd5d3a065088c4a285a6cb769fea85da8ce7c44))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.3-beta.1...v0.5.3-beta.2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.3-beta.1...v0.5.3-beta.2)\n",
